# Alien Invasion: at the beginning of combat on its controller's turn, a 1/1 red Alien with haste that must attack each combat; it gets a
# +1/+1 counter for each invasion counter on the enchantment, and then the enchantment gets one. Turn 1: a 1/1 Alien, which has haste
# and attacks (Bot2 to 19); declaring no attackers is refused. Turn 3: the first Alien is still 1/1, the new one 2/2 (one invasion
# counter), and both must attack (Bot2 to 16); the enchantment now has two invasion counters.

